msgstr "E-post ved mislykket pålogging for personale"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Free disk space first."
msgstr "Frigjør diskplass først."

#: src/modules/Staff/templates/email/mod_staff_clientfence_signin_failed.html.twig
msgid "If this was not one of your staff, check the staff accounts and consider limiting staff sign-in to chosen IP addresses or countries (Security > Settings > Sign-in)."
msgstr "Hvis forsøket ikke kom fra noen i personalet, kontroller personalkontoene og vurder å begrense pålogging for personale til bestemte IP-adresser eller land (Sikkerhet > Innstillinger > Pålogging)."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "In :system (System Settings > Currencies), give each its ISO code (for example CAD), then plan again."
msgstr "Gi hver valuta sin ISO-kode (for eksempel CAD) i :system (Systeminnstillinger > Valutaer), og planlegg importen på nytt."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "In a copy of the :system database, change each text column of the affected tables to a binary type (VARBINARY or BLOB) and then to utf8mb4 text, which keeps the bytes and reads them as UTF-8 (a plain CONVERT TO CHARACTER SET keeps the text garbled); then import from the copy."
msgstr "I en kopi av databasen til :system endrer du hver tekstkolonne i de berørte tabellene til en binær type (VARBINARY eller BLOB) og deretter til utf8mb4-tekst. Da bevares bytene og leses som UTF-8. Med bare CONVERT TO CHARACTER SET forblir teksten uleselig. Importer deretter fra kopien."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "In a copy of the :system database, repair only the affected rows, for each column: UPDATE tblclients SET col = CONVERT(CAST(CONVERT(col USING latin1) AS BINARY) USING utf8mb4) WHERE LOCATE(X'C383C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0 OR LOCATE(X'C382C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0; then import from the copy."
msgstr "Reparer bare de berørte radene i en kopi av databasen til :system, for hver kolonne: UPDATE tblclients SET col = CONVERT(CAST(CONVERT(col USING latin1) AS BINARY) USING utf8mb4) WHERE LOCATE(X'C383C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0 OR LOCATE(X'C382C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0; Importer deretter fra kopien."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Install or enable PHP's zlib extension."
msgstr "Installer eller aktiver PHP-utvidelsen zlib."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Installed (the add-on module archive is gzipped)."
msgstr "Installert (arkivet for tilleggsmoduler er komprimert med gzip)."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Make the folder and let :user write it."
msgstr "Opprett mappen og gi :user skrivetilgang."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Missing: the add-on module archive cannot be written."
msgstr "Utvidelsen mangler. Arkivet for tilleggsmoduler kan ikke skrives."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Archive.php
msgid "No archive file was given."
msgstr "Ingen arkivfil er oppgitt."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "No double-encoded client names."
msgstr "Ingen dobbeltkodede kundenavn."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not UTF-8: :tables and :more more. Text in them may come over garbled."
msgstr "Tabeller uten UTF-8: :tables og :more til. Teksten kan bli uleselig etter import."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not UTF-8: :tables. Text in them may come over garbled."
msgstr "Tabeller uten UTF-8: :tables. Teksten kan bli uleselig etter import."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not a three-letter code: :codes."
msgstr "Koder som ikke består av tre bokstaver: :codes."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not entered, and :system tickets have attachments: their messages would come over without the files."
msgstr "Vedleggsmappen er ikke oppgitt, og saker i :system har vedlegg. Meldingene ville blitt importert uten filene."

#: src/modules/Staff/templates/email/mod_staff_clientfence_signin_failed.html.twig
msgid "Open the staff panel"
msgstr "Åpne personalpanelet"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "PHP zlib extension"
msgstr "PHP-utvidelsen zlib"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise max_allowed_packet to :needed or more in the database server's settings."
msgstr "Øk max_allowed_packet til minst :needed i databaseserverens innstillinger."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise memory_limit to 256M or more in the php.ini the console uses (php --ini names it), or run the console with php -d memory_limit=512M."
msgstr "Øk memory_limit til minst 256M i php.ini som konsollen bruker (php --ini viser filen), eller kjør konsollen med php -d memory_limit=512M."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise memory_limit to 256M or more in this site's PHP settings (php.ini or the hosting panel), then reload this page."
msgstr "Øk memory_limit til minst 256M i nettstedets PHP-innstillinger (php.ini eller vertspanelet), og last inn siden på nytt."

#: src/modules/Staff/templates/email/mod_staff_clientfence_signin_failed.html.twig
